<!doctype html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Privacy information | Excel Roofing</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"/><link rel="icon" href="/images/excel-initial.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/></head><body><main class="simple-page"><a href="/"><img src="/images/logo.svg" width="150" height="108" alt="Excel Roofing home"/></a><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:60px">DEMO WEBSITE</p><h1>Privacy information</h1><p>This is a demonstration website for Excel Roofing Ltd. Contact is available by telephone or WhatsApp.</p><h2>Contacting Stuart</h2><p>This website does not collect enquiries through a contact form. Telephone links open your calling app. WhatsApp links open WhatsApp with a suggested message, which you can edit before sending. WhatsApp processes information under its own privacy policy. Information you share with Stuart is used to discuss and respond to your roofing enquiry.</p><h2>Browsing this demo</h2><p>This demo does not include advertising or analytics scripts. It stores a session preference in your browser so the logo introduction plays only once per tab session. The hosting provider may process technical request information to deliver and secure the website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about an enquiry or to request removal of submitted details, call Excel Roofing on <a href="tel:07973673255"><u>07973 673255</u></a>.</p><p>A complete business privacy notice should be confirmed before the production website launches.</p><a class="button button-navy" href="/">Back to the website</a></main></body></html>
